# Dark Mode UI

```html
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #000;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .message {
    background-color: #111;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .header {
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .light {
    background-color: #222;
    color: #ddd;
  }
  .inline {
    background-color: #333;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
```

The dark mode rules are now applied. The background is black with white text, and UI elements use dark gray accents for contrast.
